{"task_id": "Mbpp/11", "solution": "\"\"\"\nWrite a python function to remove first and last occurrence of a given character from the string.\nassert remove_Occ(\"hello\",\"l\") == \"heo\"\n\"\"\"\ndef remove_Occ(s, char):\n    \"\"\"Remove first and last occurrence of given character from string.\"\"\"\n    first_idx = s.find(char)\n    if first_idx == -1:\n        return s\n    \n    last_idx = s.rfind(char)\n    \n    if first_idx == last_idx:\n        return s[:first_idx] + s[first_idx+1:]\n    \n    result = s[:first_idx] + s[first_idx+1:last_idx] + s[last_idx+1:]\n    return result"}
