{"task_id": "Mbpp/20", "solution": "\"\"\"\nWrite a function to check if the given number is woodball or not.\nassert is_woodall(383) == True\n\"\"\"\ndef is_woodall(n):\n    \"\"\"Check if n is a Woodall number (n = k * 2^k - 1 for some positive integer k).\"\"\"\n    if n <= 0:\n        return False\n    \n    k = 1\n    while True:\n        woodall = k * (2 ** k) - 1\n        if woodall == n:\n            return True\n        if woodall > n:\n            return False\n        k += 1"}
