{"task_id": "Mbpp/20", "solution": "\"\"\"\nWrite a function to check if the given number is woodball or not.\nassert is_woodall(383) == True\n\"\"\"\ndef is_woodall(n):\n    \"\"\"Check if n is a Woodall number (n * 2^n - 1 for some positive integer n).\"\"\"\n    if n <= 0:\n        return False\n    \n    # Check if n + 1 is a power of 2\n    temp = n + 1\n    if temp & (temp - 1) != 0:\n        return False\n    \n    # Find k such that 2^k = n + 1\n    k = 0\n    while temp > 1:\n        temp //= 2\n        k += 1\n    \n    # Check if n equals k * 2^k - 1\n    return n == k * (2 ** k) - 1"}
