{"task_id": "Mbpp/77", "solution": "\"\"\"\nWrite a python function to find whether a number is divisible by 11.\nassert is_Diff (12345) == False\n\"\"\"\ndef is_Diff(n):\n    \"\"\"Check if a number is divisible by 11 using alternating sum rule.\"\"\"\n    str_n = str(abs(n))\n    alternating_sum = sum(int(digit) if i % 2 == 0 else -int(digit) for i, digit in enumerate(str_n))\n    return alternating_sum % 11 == 0"}
{"task_id": "Mbpp/71", "solution": "\"\"\"\nWrite a function to sort a list of elements.\nassert comb_sort([5, 15, 37, 25, 79]) == [5, 15, 25, 37, 79]\n\"\"\"\n```python\ndef comb_sort(arr):\n    \"\"\"Sort array using comb sort algorithm with gap reduction.\"\"\"\n    n = len(arr)\n    gap = n\n    shrink = 1.3\n    sorted_flag = False\n    \n    while gap > 1 or not sorted_flag:\n        gap = int(gap / shrink)\n        if gap < 1:\n            gap = 1\n        \n        sorted_flag = True\n        i = 0\n        \n        while i + gap < n:\n            if arr[i] > arr[i + gap]:\n                arr[i], arr[i + gap] = arr[i + gap], arr[i]\n                sorted_flag = False\n            i += 1\n    \n    return arr\n```"}
{"task_id": "Mbpp/71", "solution": "\"\"\"\nWrite a function to sort a list of elements.\nassert comb_sort([5, 15, 37, 25, 79]) == [5, 15, 25, 37, 79]\n\"\"\"\n```python\ndef comb_sort(arr):\n    \"\"\"Sort array using comb sort algorithm with gap shrinking.\"\"\"\n    gap = len(arr)\n    shrink = 1.3\n    sorted = False\n    \n    while not sorted:\n        gap = int(gap / shrink)\n        if gap <= 1:\n            gap = 1\n            sorted = True\n            \n        i = 0\n        while i + gap < len(arr):\n            if arr[i] > arr[i + gap]:\n                arr[i], arr[i + gap] = arr[i + gap], arr[i]\n                sorted = False\n            i += 1\n    \n    return arr\n```"}
{"task_id": "Mbpp/77", "solution": "\"\"\"\nWrite a python function to find whether a number is divisible by 11.\nassert is_Diff (12345) == False\n\"\"\"\ndef is_Diff(n):\n    # Calculate alternating sum of digits to check divisibility by 11\n    alternating_sum = 0\n    for i, digit in enumerate(str(abs(n))):\n        if i % 2 == 0:\n            alternating_sum += int(digit)\n        else:\n            alternating_sum -= int(digit)\n    return alternating_sum % 11 == 0"}
