{"task_id": "Mbpp/74", "solution": "\"\"\"\nWrite a function to check whether it follows the sequence given in the patterns array.\nassert is_samepatterns([\"red\",\"green\",\"green\"], [\"a\", \"b\", \"b\"])==True\n\"\"\"\ndef is_samepatterns(colors, pattern):\n    if len(colors) != len(pattern):\n        return False\n    \n    color_to_pattern = {}\n    pattern_to_color = {}\n    \n    for i in range(len(colors)):\n        color = colors[i]\n        pat = pattern[i]\n        \n        if color in color_to_pattern:\n            if color_to_pattern[color] != pat:\n                return False\n        else:\n            color_to_pattern[color] = pat\n        \n        if pat in pattern_to_color:\n            if pattern_to_color[pat] != color:\n                return False\n        else:\n            pattern_to_color[pat] = color\n    \n    return True"}
