{"task_id": "Mbpp/103", "solution": "\"\"\"\nWrite a function to find the Eulerian number a(n, m).\nassert eulerian_num(3, 1) == 4\n\"\"\"\ndef eulerian_num(n, m):\n    \"\"\"Calculate the Eulerian number A(n,m) using dynamic programming.\"\"\"\n    if m == 0 or m == n - 1:\n        return 1\n    \n    # Create DP table\n    dp = [[0] * (n) for _ in range(n + 1)]\n    \n    # Base cases\n    for i in range(n + 1):\n        if i > 0:\n            dp[i][0] = 1\n        if i > 1:\n            dp[i][i-1] = 1\n    \n    # Fill DP table using recurrence relation\n    for i in range(2, n + 1):\n        for j in range(1, min(i-1, m+1)):\n            dp[i][j] = (j + 1) * dp[i-1][j] + (i - j) * dp[i-1][j-1]\n    \n    return dp[n][m]"}
