{"task_id": "Mbpp/120", "solution": "\"\"\"\nWrite a function to find the maximum absolute product between numbers in pairs of tuples within a given list.\nassert max_product_tuple([(2, 7), (2, 6), (1, 8), (4, 9)] )==36\n\"\"\"\ndef max_product_tuple(tuple_list):\n    \"\"\"Find the maximum absolute product between numbers in pairs of tuples.\"\"\"\n    max_product = 0\n    for tuple_pair in tuple_list:\n        product = abs(tuple_pair[0] * tuple_pair[1])\n        if product > max_product:\n            max_product = product\n    return max_product"}
{"task_id": "Mbpp/120", "solution": "\"\"\"\nWrite a function to find the maximum absolute product between numbers in pairs of tuples within a given list.\nassert max_product_tuple([(2, 7), (2, 6), (1, 8), (4, 9)] )==36\n\"\"\"\n```python\ndef max_product_tuple(tuple_list):\n    \"\"\"Find the maximum absolute product between numbers in pairs of tuples.\"\"\"\n    max_product = 0\n    for tuple1 in tuple_list:\n        for tuple2 in tuple_list:\n            if tuple1 != tuple2:\n                for num1 in tuple1:\n                    for num2 in tuple2:\n                        product = abs(num1 * num2)\n                        if product > max_product:\n                            max_product = product\n    return max_product\n```"}
