{"task_id": "Mbpp/286", "solution": "\"\"\"\nWrite a function to find the largest sum of a contiguous array in the modified array which is formed by repeating the given array k times.\nassert max_sub_array_sum_repeated([10, 20, -30, -1], 4, 3) == 30\n\"\"\"\ndef max_sub_array_sum_repeated(arr, n, k):\n    \"\"\"Find the largest sum of contiguous subarray in array repeated k times.\"\"\"\n    if k == 1:\n        max_ending_here = max_so_far = arr[0]\n        for i in range(1, n):\n            max_ending_here = max(arr[i], max_ending_here + arr[i])\n            max_so_far = max(max_so_far, max_ending_here)\n        return max_so_far\n    \n    # Calculate max subarray sum for single array\n    max_kadane = arr[0]\n    curr_max = arr[0]\n    for i in range(1, n):\n        curr_max = max(arr[i], curr_max + arr[i])\n        max_kadane = max(max_kadane, curr_max)\n    \n    # Calculate prefix and suffix max sums\n    prefix_sum = arr[0]\n    max_prefix = arr[0]\n    for i in range(1, n):\n        prefix_sum += arr[i]\n        max_prefix = max(max_prefix, prefix_sum)\n    \n    suffix_sum = arr[n-1]\n    max_suffix = arr[n-1]\n    for i in range(n-2, -1, -1):\n        suffix_sum += arr[i]\n        max_suffix = max(max_suffix, suffix_sum)\n    \n    total_sum = sum(arr)\n    \n    if total_sum > 0:\n        return max(max_kadane, max_suffix + max_prefix + (k-2) * total_sum)\n    else:\n        return max(max_kadane, max_suffix + max_prefix)"}
{"task_id": "Mbpp/296", "solution": "\"\"\"\nWrite a python function to count inversions in an array.\nassert get_Inv_Count([1,20,6,4,5]) == 5\n\"\"\"\ndef get_Inv_Count(arr):\n    \"\"\"Count inversions where arr[i] > arr[j] for i < j.\"\"\"\n    count = 0\n    for i in range(len(arr)):\n        for j in range(i + 1, len(arr)):\n            if arr[i] > arr[j]:\n                count += 1\n    return count"}
