{"task_id": "Mbpp/415", "solution": "\"\"\"\nWrite a python function to find a pair with highest product from a given array of integers.\nassert max_Product([1,2,3,4,7,0,8,4]) == (7,8)\n\"\"\"\n```python\ndef max_Product(arr):\n    # Find the pair with the highest product from the array\n    max_prod = float('-inf')\n    result_pair = None\n    \n    for i in range(len(arr)):\n        for j in range(i + 1, len(arr)):\n            product = arr[i] * arr[j]\n            if product > max_prod:\n                max_prod = product\n                result_pair = (arr[i], arr[j])\n    \n    return result_pair\n```"}
