{"task_id": "Mbpp/555", "solution": "\"\"\"\nWrite a python function to find the difference between the sum of cubes of the first n natural numbers and the sum of the first n natural numbers.\nassert difference(3) == 30\n\"\"\"\n```python\ndef difference(n):\n    \"\"\"Find the difference between sum of cubes and sum of first n natural numbers.\"\"\"\n    sum_of_cubes = sum(i**3 for i in range(1, n + 1))\n    sum_of_numbers = sum(i for i in range(1, n + 1))\n    return sum_of_cubes - sum_of_numbers\n```"}
{"task_id": "Mbpp/555", "solution": "\"\"\"\nWrite a python function to find the difference between the sum of cubes of the first n natural numbers and the sum of the first n natural numbers.\nassert difference(3) == 30\n\"\"\"\ndef difference(n):\n    \"\"\"Returns the difference between sum of cubes and sum of first n natural numbers.\"\"\"\n    sum_of_numbers = n * (n + 1) // 2\n    sum_of_cubes = (n * (n + 1) // 2) ** 2\n    return sum_of_cubes - sum_of_numbers"}
