{"task_id": "Mbpp/558", "solution": "\"\"\"\nWrite a python function to find the sum of the per-digit difference between two integers.\nassert digit_distance_nums(1,2) == 1\n\"\"\"\ndef digit_distance_nums(num1, num2):\n    \"\"\"Find the sum of per-digit differences between two integers.\"\"\"\n    str1, str2 = str(abs(num1)), str(abs(num2))\n    max_len = max(len(str1), len(str2))\n    str1 = str1.zfill(max_len)\n    str2 = str2.zfill(max_len)\n    return sum(abs(int(d1) - int(d2)) for d1, d2 in zip(str1, str2))"}
{"task_id": "Mbpp/559", "solution": "\"\"\"\nWrite a function to find the sum of the largest contiguous sublist in the given list.\nassert max_sub_array_sum([-2, -3, 4, -1, -2, 1, 5, -3], 8) == 7\n\"\"\"\n```python\ndef max_sub_array_sum(arr, n):\n    \"\"\"Find the sum of the largest contiguous subarray using Kadane's algorithm.\"\"\"\n    max_ending_here = max_so_far = arr[0]\n    \n    for i in range(1, n):\n        max_ending_here = max(arr[i], max_ending_here + arr[i])\n        max_so_far = max(max_so_far, max_ending_here)\n    \n    return max_so_far\n```"}
{"task_id": "Mbpp/558", "solution": "\"\"\"\nWrite a python function to find the sum of the per-digit difference between two integers.\nassert digit_distance_nums(1,2) == 1\n\"\"\"\ndef digit_distance_nums(num1, num2):\n    \"\"\"Calculate sum of absolute differences between corresponding digits of two integers.\"\"\"\n    str1, str2 = str(abs(num1)), str(abs(num2))\n    max_len = max(len(str1), len(str2))\n    str1 = str1.zfill(max_len)\n    str2 = str2.zfill(max_len)\n    return sum(abs(int(d1) - int(d2)) for d1, d2 in zip(str1, str2))"}
