{"task_id": "Mbpp/638", "solution": "\"\"\"\nWrite a function to calculate the wind chill index rounded to the next integer given the wind velocity in km/h and a temperature in celsius.\nassert wind_chill(120,35)==40\n\"\"\"\n```python\ndef wind_chill(wind_velocity, temperature):\n    \"\"\"Calculate wind chill index and round to next integer.\"\"\"\n    import math\n    wci = 13.12 + 0.6215 * temperature - 11.37 * (wind_velocity ** 0.16) + 0.3965 * temperature * (wind_velocity ** 0.16)\n    return math.ceil(wci)\n```"}
