{"task_id": "Mbpp/735", "solution": "\"\"\"\nWrite a python function to toggle bits of the number except the first and the last bit. \nassert toggle_middle_bits(9) == 15\n\"\"\"\ndef toggle_middle_bits(n):\n    \"\"\"Toggle all bits except the first and last bit of the number.\"\"\"\n    if n <= 3:\n        return n\n    \n    # Find the position of the most significant bit\n    msb_pos = n.bit_length() - 1\n    \n    # Create mask with 1s for middle bits only\n    mask = ((1 << (msb_pos - 1)) - 1) << 1\n    \n    return n ^ mask"}
