{"task_id": "Mbpp/752", "solution": "\"\"\"\nWrite a function to find the nth jacobsthal number.  0, 1, 1, 3, 5, 11, 21, 43, 85, 171, 341, 683, 1365, 2731, ...\nassert jacobsthal_num(5) == 11\n\"\"\"\ndef jacobsthal_num(n):\n    \"\"\"Returns the nth Jacobsthal number using the recurrence relation J(n) = J(n-1) + 2*J(n-2).\"\"\"\n    if n == 0:\n        return 0\n    if n == 1:\n        return 1\n    \n    a, b = 0, 1\n    for i in range(2, n + 1):\n        a, b = b, b + 2 * a\n    return b"}
